:: StoryTitle
The Night Shift

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "32ED7F51-BB19-4C18-BD5D-959282437C79",
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "format-version": "3.3.9",
  "start": "Start"
}

:: Start
You are locked in the campus lab. It is 11 PM. The lights hum.

[[Try the front door->Door]]
[[Check the server closet->Closet]]

:: Door
The front door is locked. The handle does not move.

[[Shake the handle hard->EndingCaught]]
[[Go back->Start]]

:: Closet
A key card hangs on a hook. A fan roars. A vent cover is loose.

[[Take the key card->Hallway]]
[[Go back->Start]]

:: Hallway
A side exit has a card reader. A guard sleeps in a chair nearby.

[[Swipe the key card->EndingFree]]
[[Wake the guard to ask for help->EndingCaught]]

:: Vent
The vent is tight. Cold air blows from the far end. You see the roof.

[[Climb out onto the roof->EndingFree]]

:: EndingFree
You step into the cool night air. You are free!

:: EndingCaught
The guard turns on the light. You are caught.
